      "created_at": "2015-01-14T04:58:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was going to post a snarky comment about how it's spelled \"<span>חנוכה\", except then further research seemed to indicate that both \"</span><span>חנוכה\" and \"</span><span>חנכה\" are deemed acceptable spellings (the difference hinges on a letter which is sometimes a vowel, and whether it's pronounced 'Hanookah' or 'Hanekah'), so I guess there really is confusion about how to spell it.</span></p>",
