      "raw": "[quote=\"jsz2\"]\n\nI was going to post a snarky comment about how it&#39;s spelled &quot;חנוכה&quot;, except then further research seemed to indicate that both &quot;חנוכה&quot; and &quot;חנכה&quot; are deemed acceptable spellings (the difference hinges on a letter which is sometimes a vowel, and whether it&#39;s pronounced &#39;Hanookah&#39; or &#39;Hanekah&#39;), so I guess there really is confusion about how to spell it.\n\n[/quote]\n\nBleh, for some reason I can&#39;t get Hebrew to come up. However, the former version is wrong, and the latter is the correct version. The difference is whehther or not you write the vowels in. If you don&#39;t sometimes you use helper letters to make something clearer, but it is not the correct version.\n",
